## What Did NOT Work (and why) — CRITICAL

- **OpenAI BILLING HARD LIMIT** (`billing_hard_limit_reached`) hit mid-batch → 2 shots
  (a2_sc10 #17, a4_sc01 #34) failed «No episode reference assets inserted» (the real reason was
  console-only — observability gap). Director topped up balance → both re-fired + landed.
- **Silent early-return on over-attempted shots** — re-firing a shot with many prior autonomous
  attempts returns 1.5s/null/no-job (cap-ish, but `regen_cap_halt`=0 logged). Worked around by
  raising `SHOT_REGEN_CAP=40` for the batch (since restored to default 6).
- **Polина approval latency** — she reacts to nudges but does NOT approve plans after PASS in
  reasonable time; Тео auto-approved throughout (fallback). Mode-3 «nudge→execute» gap persists.
- **ECONNRESET under load** — 35 concurrent designers/artists crashed the first batch monitor
  (no retry); hardened version (retry+idempotent) recovered without losing server-side progress.
- **a2_sc23 visual-REVISION** — image good but auto visual-review demoted it; REVISION→APPROVED
  blocked, fixed via REVISION→REVIEW (DB) → route approve.

