  to [[backlog_observability_failures_not_surfaced]].
- **Message prefix** — Dubai time `HH:MM ~ ` on every message ([[director_message_timestamp_dubai]];
  use plain `date '+%H:%M'`, machine local IS Dubai; NOT `TZ='Asia/Dubai'`).

